SIM-07: compute pump energy averages without overwriting the totals

saveenergy() turned the energy totals accumulated by addenergy() into
averages and percentages in place, in pump->Energy. It runs on every
EN_initQ with the save flag, so a second EN_solveQ or EN_saveH on the
same hydraulics divided the averages again, in the output file and in
the report. Move the conversion into pumpenergystats(), which works on a
copy, and use it in both saveenergy() and writeenergy().

Apply from the root of an EPANET checkout at 83e25bb:
    git apply SIM-07_fix.patch

